WEBVTT

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.943
Know what you should pay. Prove what you shouldn’t.

00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:23.420
Capture a sealed parcel. The contract calculates the rest.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.358
1.8 kg volumetric. 2 kg billable. ₹120 expected freight.

00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:30.064
Match courier invoice rows to measured shipments.

00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:34.584
Three rows matched. One new billing difference flagged.

00:00:34.584 --> 00:00:40.885
Expected ₹120. Courier billed ₹160. Review the ₹40 difference.

00:00:40.885 --> 00:00:43.505
Export the rate snapshot, invoice, calculation, and attached photos.

00:00:43.505 --> 00:00:50.143
Only a recorded, referenced credit counts as recovered.

00:00:50.143 --> 00:01:01.334
Compare cartons at the same scale. Find the wasted space.

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:04.770
50% less parcel volume. Protection still needs a physical check.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:09.400
₹40 less freight − ₹5 extra packaging = ₹35 estimated net saving.
